<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Nouveau commentaire - Midgar</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background: #0d0f0f;
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            color: #E6FFF6;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1f1e 0%, #0d0f0f 100%);
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(24,227,164,0.4);
            animation: fadeIn 1s ease-in-out;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #18E3A4;
            font-size: 28px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-shadow: 0 0 5px #18E3A4;
        }
        .message {
            color: #B0B9B6;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .highlight {
            color: #18E3A4;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-shadow: 0 0 5px #18E3A4;
        }
        .comment-box {
            background: rgba(24, 227, 164, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(24, 227, 164, 0.3);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 30px 0;
            text-align: left;
            color: #E6FFF6;
            font-style: italic;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(24,227,164,0.2);
        }
        .comment-box::before {
            content: "“";
            font-size: 40px;
            color: #18E3A4;
            opacity: 0.5;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: -20px;
        }
        .comment-author {
            color: #18E3A4;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 15px;
            text-align: right;
        }
        .comment-author::before {
            content: "— ";
            color: #18E3A4;
        }
        a.button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 14px 28px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #E63946, #B71C1C);
            color: #FFFFFF;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(230,57,70,0.3);
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        a.button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(230,57,70,0.4);
        }
        .button i {
            margin-right: 8px;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            color: #B0B9B6;
            font-size: 12px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(24,227,164,0.2);
            padding-top: 20px;
        }
        .info-text {
            color: #B0B9B6;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        .creation-title {
            color: #18E3A4;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 10px 0;
            text-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(24,227,164,0.3);
        }
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-20px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>💬 Nouveau commentaire</h1>
        
        <div class="message">
            Bonjour <span class="highlight">{{ creatorName }}</span>,<br><br>
            
            <span class="highlight">{{ authorName }}</span> a commenté votre 
            <span class="highlight">{{ creationType }}</span> :
        </div>
        
        <div class="creation-title">
            « {{ creationTitle }} »
        </div>
        
        <div class="comment-box">
            {{ commentaire.contenu }}
            <div class="comment-author">{{ authorName }}</div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="info-text">
            Vous pouvez supprimer ce commentaire si nécessaire.
        </div>
        
        <a href="{{ deleteUrl }}" class="button">
            🗑️ Supprimer ce commentaire
        </a>
        
        <div class="footer">
            Si vous ne souhaitez pas recevoir ces notifications,<br>
            vous pouvez les désactiver dans les paramètres de votre profil.<br>
            &copy; 2026 Midgar Fantasy Platform
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>